# The Recorder stores everything, and sends commands to the devices
user recorder
topic read owntracks/#
topic write owntracks/+/+/cmd

# Everyone publishes only under their own user name, and reads the
# locations, events and cards of everyone else
pattern readwrite owntracks/%u/#
pattern read owntracks/+/+
pattern read owntracks/+/+/event
pattern read owntracks/+/+/info
